    selfhosted_unit_decl_same_name_overwrites_2026-11-26, P2, open, "Self-hosted compiler: two unit declarations with the same name overwrite each other in the bare-name unit pool", src/compiler/10.frontend/core/types.spl, 1117, NONE, 2026-11-26, 2026-11-26, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    selfhosted_unit_decl_same_name_overwrites_2026-11-26, 0, "Found by code read on release/1.0.0 12aeda7fb1d while fixing the seed twin (SPL-UNIT-002 bare-name unit lookup). Not reproduced by a run: no self-hosted full-CLI binary is deployed on the finding host. unit_decl_register_origin (types.spl:1114-1124) finds an existing row by name alone via unit_decl_find (types.spl:1089) and rewrites its role, short symbol, underlying type tag, alias target and origin in place."

